ate**: predicted binding energy is\nwithin 10% of AME. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.partitions_of_six_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.partitions_of_six_count","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OptionE/DeuteronVerification.lean#L86-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.partitions_of_six","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.partitions_of_six","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OptionE/DeuteronVerification.lean#L72-L84","doc":"The 11 partitions of 6 (sorted by length). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.deuteron_partition_count_eq_eleven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.deuteron_partition_count_eq_eleven","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OptionE/DeuteronVerification.lean#L69-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.deuteron_partition_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.deuteron_partition_count","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OptionE/DeuteronVerification.lean#L66-L67","doc":"Partition count for deuteron Wedderburn (p(6) = 11). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.closure_threshold_MeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptionE.DeuteronVerification.closure_threshold_MeV","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa